					<description><![CDATA[HVAC pocket filters are essential components in air handling units, used to maintain optimal air quality and system efficiency. These filters, sometimes called bag filters, consist of multiple pockets that enhance their surface area and capture capacity.]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Bag-type medium-efficiency filter is mainly used in central air-conditioning and centralized air supply systems, and can be used for intermediate-level filtration of air-conditioning systemsto protect the next-level filter and the system itself in places where air purification is not strictly required. The air processed by the medium efficiency filter can be sent directly to the user.</p>
<p>Bag-type medium effect filter, frame with cold plate spray, galvanized sheet and other forms, filter material, non-woven fabric, glass fiber, etc.</p>
<p>Bag-type medium efficiency filters are widely used in industrial air purification systems, pharmaceuticals, hospitals, electronics, food and other industrial purification, and can also be used as front-end filtration of high-efficiency air filters to reduce the load of high-efficiency air filters and extend their use. life. Due to the large windward surface of the bag filter, it has a large dust holding capacity and a low wind speed, and is considered to be the best medium-efficiency filter structure at present.</p>
